{
  "slug": "agents2-week-2026-10-04",
  "title": "agents2: what changed this week",
  "description": "4 to 10 October 2026. Six themes, explained with diagrams: how Pi handles long sessions, the agent team, skills reaching every runtime, separate home and work profiles, a more reliable toolchain, and Herdr theming.",
